<h2>Deleting Users</h2>

<p>
    When someone leaves your team or no longer needs access:
</p>

<ol>
    <li>Find the user in the list</li>
    <li>Double-click the row or click <strong>"Manage"</strong> to review their details</li>
    <li>Click <strong>"Delete"</strong> to remove their access</li>
    <li>Confirm the deletion</li>
</ol>

<p>
    <strong>What happens when you delete a user:</strong>
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Their access is removed immediately</li>
    <li>They can no longer log in</li>
    <li>Their historical activity remains in the system (for audit purposes)</li>
    <li>Any work assigned to them may need to be reassigned</li>
</ul>

<p>
    <strong>Before deleting:</strong> Review the user's details to make sure you're removing the right person, and consider reassigning any active work they're responsible for.
</p>

