<h2>Viewing User Activity</h2>

<p>
    The user management interface may show information about each user's activity, such as:
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Last login time</li>
    <li>Account creation date</li>
    <li>Recent activity</li>
</ul>

<p>
    This helps you understand who's actively using the system and identify accounts that might need attention.
</p>

