<h2>Best Practices</h2>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Add users promptly</strong> – When someone joins the team, add them right away so they can get started</li>
    <li><strong>Verify Desktop Username</strong> – Double-check that the Windows username is correct for Outlook/Tray integration</li>
    <li><strong>Keep information current</strong> – Update phone numbers, emails, and other details as they change</li>
    <li><strong>Remove access promptly</strong> – Delete users who no longer need access for security</li>
    <li><strong>Use secure password sharing</strong> – Share temporary passwords through secure channels</li>
    <li><strong>Review before deleting</strong> – Always check user details before removing access</li>
</ul>

