<h2>Troubleshooting User Issues</h2>

<p>
    If a user is having trouble:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Can't log in</strong> – Reset their password and verify their email is correct</li>
    <li><strong>Outlook not working</strong> – Check that their Desktop Username matches their Windows username</li>
    <li><strong>Tray not connecting</strong> – Verify Desktop Username and that they're logged into the correct Windows account</li>
    <li><strong>Missing permissions</strong> – Check their role and adjust if needed</li>
</ul>

<p>
    Most user issues are resolved by verifying their information is correct and matches what's in Windows/Outlook.
</p>

